294 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/P 243 0 R
/T (As a student project team, we aim to develop a Salesforce-based Cricket Player Performance Tracking Application to maintain and manage player information for each match in a systematic manner. The application will include custom objects such as Player and Match Performance, along with appropriate fields and relationships. It will allow us to record player statistics, monitor individual performance, generate useful reports, and gain practical knowledge of how Salesforce can be used to create an effective sports management system.)
/E (As a student project team, we aim to develop a Salesforce-based Cricket Player Performance Tracking Application to maintain and manage player information for each match in a systematic manner. The application will include custom objects such as Player and Match Performance, along with appropriate fields and relationships. It will allow us to record player statistics, monitor individual performance, generate useful reports, and gain practical knowledge of how Salesforce can be used to create an effective sports management system.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [17]
>>
endobj
295 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/P 243 0 R
/T (CRICKSTATS is a Salesforce-based application developed as an academic project to manage and analyze cricket player performance. Instead of storing player statistics in different files, the application organizes player information and match-wise performance details in a single structured system. It makes use of Salesforce objects, fields, relationships, flows, reports, and dashboards. The system is designed to simplify the process of entering match statistics and provide a clear and organized view of player performance for coaches, managers, analysts, and students.)
/E (CRICKSTATS is a Salesforce-based application developed as an academic project to manage and analyze cricket player performance. Instead of storing player statistics in different files, the application organizes player information and match-wise performance details in a single structured system. It makes use of Salesforce objects, fields, relationships, flows, reports, and dashboards. The system is designed to simplify the process of entering match statistics and provide a clear and organized view of player performance for coaches, managers, analysts, and students.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [18]
>>
endobj
