/Title (As a student project team, we aim to develop a Salesforce-based Cricket Player Performance Tracking Application to maintain and manage player information for each match in a systematic manner. The application will include custom objects such as Player and Match Performance, along with appropriate fields and relationships. It will allow us to record player statistics, monitor individual performance, generate useful reports, and gain practical knowledge of how Salesforce can be used to create an effective sports management system.)
