/Title (CRICKSTATS is a Salesforce-based application developed as an academic project to manage and analyze cricket player performance. Instead of storing player statistics in different files, the application organizes player information and match-wise performance details in a single structured system. It makes use of Salesforce objects, fields, relationships, flows, reports, and dashboards. The system is designed to simplify the process of entering match statistics and provide a clear and organized view of player performance for coaches, managers, analysts, and students.)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1746 0 R
>>
